     1	"""A metered, consumable budget for one campaign run.
     2	
     3	This is the metering half of the improvement plan's cheap-vs-precise
     4	scheduler (docs/IMPROVEMENT_PLAN_V03.md, W1-3): usage is accrued from real
     5	ToolCallRecord timestamps and reported model usage rather than trusted
     6	purely on a worker's self-report.  The full tier-ordered escalation
     7	scheduler (VALIDITY/FAST/PRECISE/ACCEPTANCE, Kendall-tau ranking fidelity)
     8	is a larger, separate effort this ledger is designed to plug into later; on
     9	its own it gives a campaign a hard, honest stop condition.
