agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:79:    "contract_impact": "The existing 1.2 recovery contract was insufficient for the new canonical projection invariant, so the persisted topic state explicitly bumps to 1.3 and topic-observation-state-recovery-v2. The batch input schema remains 1.0."
